all (?P<k>\w+) one two -1  0-3 4-7 |  0 3 0 3 4 7 4 7
replace two:one four:three x
replace func <a=b> <c=d>
split  "" " " ""
split n  "" " c=d e=f"
quote a\.b\*c\(d\)\[e\]\{f\}\|g\^h\$i\\j
